{"id": "3268363", "name": "טיול על גרף 1 - פונקציה ומשטח אקראיים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "f1", "params": ["t"], "body": "f1"}, {"name": "f2", "params": ["t"], "body": "f2"}, {"name": "f3", "params": ["t"], "body": "f3"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: right;\">נתונה הפונקציה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;\">\\(f(x,y)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div style=\"margin: 14px auto 4px auto; max-width: 560px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #665f6b; text-align: right; margin-bottom: 6px;\">גרף אינטראקטיבי של המשטח. ניתן לגרור ולסובב את התצוגה.</div>\n[[jsxgraph width=\"100%\" aspect-ratio=\"1.15\"]] var board = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, { boundingbox: [-5,5,5,-5], axis: false, pan: {enabled:false}, zoom: {enabled:false}, showCopyright: false, showNavigation: true }); var xybox = [-1.5,1.5]; var zbox = [-18,18]; var view = board.create('view3d', [[-3.7,-3.7],[7.4,7.4],[xybox,xybox,zbox]], { projection: 'central', xPlaneRear: {visible:false}, yPlaneRear: {visible:false}, trackball: {enabled:true} } ); var F = board.jc.snippet('{{CT:1}}', true, 'x,y', true); view.create('functiongraph3d', [F,xybox,xybox], { strokeWidth: 0.7, fillOpacity: 0.45 } ); [[/jsxgraph]]</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; text-align: right;\">נתונות גם שלוש מסילות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha_i:[a,b]\\to\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span>. לכל מסילה נגדיר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_i=f\\circ\\alpha_i\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_i(t)=f(\\alpha_i(t))\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: right;\">המסילות</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 9px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\\(\\alpha_1(t)=({{CT:2}},{{CT:3}})\\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\\(\\alpha_2(t)=({{CT:4}},{{CT:5}})\\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\\(\\alpha_3(t)=({{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 14px; margin-bottom: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin: 0 4px 8px 4px; text-align: right;\">הגרפים של ההרכבות</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 4px 14px 4px; text-align: right;\">שלושת הגרפים הבאים הם הגרפים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_1,g_2,g_3\\)</span> בסדר כלשהו, בתחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([-2\\pi,2\\pi]\\)</span>.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 280px; max-width: 300px; min-width: 260px; background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">גרף 1</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center;\">{{CT:8}}</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 280px; max-width: 300px; min-width: 260px; background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">גרף 2</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center;\">{{CT:9}}</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 280px; max-width: 300px; min-width: 260px; background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">גרף 3</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center;\">{{CT:10}}</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: right;\">התאימו בין ההרכבות לגרפים</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 14px 0; text-align: right;\">לכל אחת מן הפונקציות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_i=f\\circ\\alpha_i\\)</span> בחרו את הגרף המתאים. כל אחד מן הגרפים 1, 2, 3 משמש פעם אחת.</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;\">\\(g_1=f\\circ\\alpha_1\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate;\">[[input:ans1]]\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;\">\\(g_2=f\\circ\\alpha_2\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate;\">[[input:ans2]]\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;\">\\(g_3=f\\circ\\alpha_3\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate;\">[[input:ans3]]\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: right; line-height: 1.75;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">עבור מסילה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha(t)=(x(t),y(t))\\)</span> מתקיים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0;\">\\[ (f\\circ\\alpha)(t)=f(x(t),y(t)) \\]</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 12px 0 8px 0;\">כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x,y)={{CT:0}}\\)</span>. לכן מציבים בכל פעם את שני רכיבי המסילה בתוך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span>. בגרסה שקיבלתם מתקבל:</p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 10px;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #D9D1DD; text-align: center;\">המסילה</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #D9D1DD; text-align: center;\">ההרכבה</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #D9D1DD; text-align: center;\">הגרף</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEECEF; text-align: center;\">\\(\\alpha_1(t)=({{CT:2}},{{CT:3}})\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEECEF; text-align: center;\">\\(g_1(t)={{CT:11}}\\)</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEECEF; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">גרף {{CT:12}}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEECEF; text-align: center;\">\\(\\alpha_2(t)=({{CT:4}},{{CT:5}})\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEECEF; text-align: center;\">\\(g_2(t)={{CT:13}}\\)</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEECEF; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">גרף {{CT:14}}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\(\\alpha_3(t)=({{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\(g_3(t)={{CT:15}}\\)</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 9px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">גרף {{CT:16}}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 14px 0 6px 0;\">לאחר שמקבלים את שלושת הביטויים, מזהים את הגרפים לפי מחזוריות, זוגיות או אי־זוגיות, נקודות אפס, סימן הפונקציה, קצב הגידול והאמפליטודה.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">התאמה נכונה, יפה מאוד.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">חלק מן ההתאמות נכונות. עיינו במשוב המפורט שליד כל פונקציה.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">ההתאמה אינה נכונה. חשבו תחילה את ההרכבות ורק אחר כך השוו לגרפים.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sol1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">ההתאמה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_1\\)</span> נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">ההתאמה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_1\\)</span> אינה נכונה. כאן מתקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_1(t)={{CT:11}}\\)</span>. השוו את הביטוי למחזוריות, לאפסים ולצורת שלושת הגרפים. הגרף הנכון הוא <strong>גרף {{CT:12}}</strong>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "sol2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">ההתאמה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_2\\)</span> נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">ההתאמה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_2\\)</span> אינה נכונה. כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_2(t)={{CT:13}}\\)</span>. בדקו במיוחד סימטריה, סימן, אמפליטודה וקצב גידול. הגרף הנכון הוא <strong>גרף {{CT:14}}</strong>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "sol3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">ההתאמה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_3\\)</span> נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">ההתאמה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_3\\)</span> אינה נכונה. לאחר ההצבה מתקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g_3(t)={{CT:15}}\\)</span>. השוו את הביטוי לגרפים לפי נקודות האפס, המחזוריות וההתנהגות בקצות התחום. הגרף הנכון הוא <strong>גרף {{CT:16}}</strong>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["aa", "bb", "cc", "f", "f1", "f2", "f3", "gg1", "gg2", "gg3", "lst_trigo", "opts1", "opts2", "opts3", "path_lst", "sol1", "sol2", "sol3", "solsx", "solsy", "x1", "x11", "x2", "x22", "x3", "x33", "y1", "y11", "y2", "y22", "y3", "y33"], "nvariants": 50}